  "details": "When receiving notifications for groups, I only get the first few dozen characters of the body of the announcement, instead of the subject.\n\n===================================================\n\nExample of announcement:\n\nSubject: Guild meeting December 6!\n\nBody: We're going to be discussing important information about our guild, etc. etc.\n\n===================================================\n\nWhat displays on my incoming notification is \"We're going to be discussing important information about our...\", and I feel like that this is incorrect. I would rather display the subject for my group announcement rather than the details on the notification.",
